.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH songrec-audio-file-to-fingerprint 1  "audio-file-to-fingerprint " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
songrec\-audio\-file\-to\-fingerprint \- Generate a Shazam fingerprint from a sound file, and print it to the standard output.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsongrec audio\-file\-to\-fingerprint\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIinput_file\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Generate a Shazam fingerprint from a sound file, and print it to the standard output.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIinput_file\fR>
The .WAV or .MP3 file to generate an audio fingerprint for.
